## Phase 2: AI Generation Engine
**Duration:** 8 working days (Week 3–4)
**Goal:** Reliably produce 50 unique, schema-valid questions in under 3 minutes, with fallback handling.

### Backend Tasks

| # | Task | Days |
|---|---|---|
| 2.1 | `POST /api/session/create` — validate retake eligibility, create `exam_sessions` record, issue exam session token | 1 |
| 2.2 | Build `GenerationService`: fires 5 parallel OpenAI calls per track, each with structured JSON mode prompt | 2 |
| 2.3 | Per-thread timeout (45s), retry-once logic, buffer pool fallback integration | 1 |
| 2.4 | JSON schema validator (`ajv`) for all 50 incoming question objects | 0.5 |
| 2.5 | Question fingerprinting: SHA-256 stem hash, overlap check against last 3 attempts | 0.5 |
| 2.6 | Write question fingerprints + activate session (`status = 'ready'`) on success | 0.5 |
| 2.7 | `GET /api/session/[id]/status` — polling endpoint for generation progress (0–100%) | 0.5 |
| 2.8 | Buffer pool schema, seed script, and admin upload endpoint | 1 |
| 2.9 | Abort logic: > 2 threads fail → mark session `aborted`, do NOT increment attempt count | 0.5 |

### Frontend Tasks

| # | Task | Days |
|---|---|---|
| 2.10 | Generation screen with animated progress bar (polling `/status` every 3s) | 0.5 |
| 2.11 | "Audit Wisdom" rotating tips component (Associate: Clause Reminders, Professional: Auditor Ethics) | 0.5 |
| 2.12 | "Enter Exam" CTA state transition on generation success; error + retry state on failure | 0.5 |

### Exit Criteria
- [ ] Associate and Professional tracks both complete generation with valid 50-question payloads.
- [ ] Deliberate thread timeout test: buffer pool activates correctly.
- [ ] Overlap check: re-generating for the same user returns < 4 duplicate question hashes in any thread.
- [ ] Abort path: session is not created if > 2 threads fail; attempt count unchanged.

