## Risk Register

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|---|
| OpenAI API latency > 45s per thread | Medium | High | Buffer pool fallback (Phase 2); alert on fallback rate |
| OpenAI cost overrun at scale | Medium | High | Usage hard cap in OpenAI project; per-user generation rate limit |
| ISO/BSI IP complaint | Low | Very High | Strict paraphrase-only prompt enforcement; ToS disclaimer |
| Redis timer drift under load | Low | High | Load test before launch; server-side reconstruction fallback |
| Spam registrations exhaust AI quota | Medium | High | OTP gate + IP rate limit + generation rate limit per user |
| Certificate JPEG rendering fails | Low | Medium | Sentry alert on Sharp errors; retry queue for failed jobs |
| Beta users find systematic AI question errors | Medium | High | Buffer pool + admin question review process in Phase 6 |

